{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" of TelemetryDeck’s Ingest API v3, so an "},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can send events to an organization’s "},{"code":"POST \/v3\/<namespace>\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/telemetrydeckencoding\/telemetrydeckbatchencoder"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder\/init(appID:testMode:plan:limit:)"]},{"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder\/requests(for:)"]},{"title":"Type Aliases","anchor":"Type-Aliases","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder\/Failure"]},{"title":"Type Properties","anchor":"Type-Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder\/batchLimit"]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder.swift#L85","fileName":"TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder.swift"},"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder","kind":"ide